# Nothing this package produces belongs in git. install.sh writes only to the
# prefix and bin dir you choose, and the test suite writes only to its scratch
# root — so this list is purely defensive.

# Scaffolding a session would drop here if an agent is ever run in this repo.
# The launcher already hides and removes these, but belt and braces.
/.claude/agents/
/.codex/agents/

# /DEVLOG.md was listed here while the only DEVLOG.md this repo ever saw was a
# session scaffold, which would otherwise have shown up as noise. The repo now
# keeps a real logbook, so it is tracked. Nothing has to guard it: the launcher
# copies the scaffold only when no DEVLOG.md exists, and removes it only while it
# is still byte-identical to agent.d/DEVLOG.template.md (bin/ai:1423, bin/ai:1510).

# Editor / OS noise
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
